---
// Raio-X do Site teaser — liga a home (clínica) à ferramenta /raio-x-site.
// Copy clínica-framed (a home é Perfil A); a página em si é ICP-neutra, o que
// é o que impede as duas de brigarem pelos mesmos termos.
// Copy vive em translations.json (auditSiteCta) + fallback hardcoded aqui (regra dupla).
---

<section class="rx-home-cta section" id="raio-x-cta">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="rx-home-card">
      <div class="rx-home-icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"></circle>
          <line x1="16.5" y1="16.5" x2="21" y2="21"></line>
          <line x1="8" y1="11" x2="14" y2="11"></line>
          <line x1="11" y1="8" x2="11" y2="14"></line>
        </svg>
      </div>

      <div class="rx-home-text">
        <span class="section-label" data-i18n="auditSiteCta.label">Ferramenta gratuita</span>
        <h2 class="rx-home-title" data-i18n="auditSiteCta.title">
          O que o site da sua clínica deixa escapar?
        </h2>
        <p class="rx-home-desc" data-i18n="auditSiteCta.desc">
          A paciente lê o site por alguns segundos e decide se chama a recepção ou fecha a aba. O raio-x
          lê os 5 pontos que ela olha e mostra qual está custando agenda. Leva 1 minuto, sem cadastro.
        </p>
      </div>

      <a href="/raio-x-site/" class="btn-primary-dark rx-home-btn">
        <span data-i18n="auditSiteCta.btn">Fazer o raio-x do site</span>
        <span class="icon-circle">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
            <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .rx-home-cta {
    padding: 64px 0;
    background: var(--background);
  }

  .rx-home-card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.75rem;
    padding: 2rem 2.25rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(26, 75, 81, 0.05), rgba(126, 174, 137, 0.1));
  }

  .rx-home-icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 56px;
    height: 56px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    background: var(--background);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    color: var(--primary);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .rx-home-text {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .rx-home-text .section-label {
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .rx-home-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 26px;
    line-height: 1.25;
    color: var(--text-heading);
  }

  .rx-home-desc {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    max-width: 620px;
  }

  .rx-home-btn {
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 810px) {
    .rx-home-card {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      padding: 1.75rem;
    }

    .rx-home-title {
      font-size: 22px;
    }

    .rx-home-btn {
      align-self: stretch;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }
  }
</style>
